  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這是《Prehistoric World》整合包的預設背景資源包。它靈感來自《Unusual Prehistory》模組，僅包含該模組中的恐龍與相關元素圖片。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">您可以自由將此資源包加入您自己的史前主題整合包中，並隨意修改。請記得 — 您需要安裝 <em>Loading Backgrounds</em> 模組才能正常運作。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所需模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器與朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找與朋友遊玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是您的最佳選擇！他們提供最具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用折扣碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 的折扣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>伺服器上可以使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！運作完全沒問題！請記住，搭配模組與朋友遊玩的絕佳選擇是 BisectHosting，透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可享有 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此資源包能否用於整合包中？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但請確保僅發布於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge。上傳至其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，且絕對不被允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，若您考慮將其加入您在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上的整合包，我們將不勝感激。如需任何微小調整或有疑問，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製此模組的影片並發布在我的頻道上嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！您完全可以自由在您的頻道遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝您的支持！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
